   "status": "MISMATCH",
   "ruling": "Ruling: scope; i1040sc p. 8, Line 20a, 'if you leased a vehicle for a term of 30 days or more, you may have to reduce your deduction by the inclusion amount'. A lease with an inclusion amount is refused upstream by sc.special ('you lease a car, truck or van for 30 days or more that was worth more than $62,000 when the lease began ... (an “inclusion amount”)'), whose Yes refuses the business through sc.screened, so line 20a is computed only for leases with no inclusion amount.",
   "subject_key": "d3215b7a54ef663952cfd77809519be59210e0ebdf844671ba3d8b556866ac24"
  },
  {
   "key": "(b)",
   "record": "6b011ddfabd9695d770e0de48daf57bfb6a75a4dbad42308a0609d274defb073",
   "status": "MISMATCH",
   "ruling": "Ruling: representation; i4562 p. 14, Column (b): the column is printed from the year the filer gives. The depreciation the tool figures uses only the recovery year (the year placed in service) and, for 2025, the quarter (scveh.quarter); a vehicle converted between personal and business use in 2025 is refused by scveh.converted. No amount turns on the day.",
   "subject_key": "5eec35adf88851a43b26dfd97a2a9a72ec8d350d0ce29f8fa4fc9a6ade1e3c5b"
  },
